{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_01",
      "hash": "89318c21a2f32408",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Welcome to 枯叶道馆！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_07",
      "hash": "89319221a2f32e3a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗨！Baby！\\nYou就是challenger吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_08",
      "hash": "89318521a2f31823",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哈哈～！\\n就凭you那一点点的power，\\c\\n居然想向me发起挑战，\\nVery有胆量啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_09",
      "hash": "89318421a2f31670",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "宝可梦对战\\n可没有那么easy～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_10",
      "hash": "892e0721a2f00c32",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Me可以让everyone\\n浑身麻麻的feel！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_03_07",
      "hash": "47fdc3356398ac8b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_02",
      "hash": "89318f21a2f32921",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "OK！\\n橙色徽章就给you了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8020_sys_01",
      "hash": "cbbdb782c305534c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从马志士那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]橙色徽章[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_03",
      "hash": "89318e21a2f3276e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "And！\\c\\n给拥有special实力的you，\\n这是me的一点心意！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8020_sys_02",
      "hash": "cbbdba82c3055865",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从马志士那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]马志士的签名[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_04",
      "hash": "89319121a2f32c87",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "………………"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_11",
      "hash": "892e0821a2f00de5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哈哈哈！不用worry！\\n这个当然也会送给you！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main8020_sys_03",
      "hash": "cbbdb982c30556b2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从马志士那里\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]\\r\\n“[VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_05",
      "hash": "89319021a2f32ad4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式学习器36是\\n电属性麻麻十万伏特！\\c\\nPlease教给electric宝可梦噢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_06",
      "hash": "89319321a2f32fed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hey！\\n还要给you一个小建议！\\c\\nElectric power\\n麻麻的很强力～！\\c\\n不过面对地面属性时，\\nPower会被吸收走，\\r\\n完全useless唷～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_03_06",
      "hash": "47fdc2356398aad8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 15]"
    }
  ],
